# Lab 7 style REST Client requests for the Floci API Gateway.
# Copy the API_URL printed by `bash infra/lab7-vars.sh` into @baseUrl.
@baseUrl = http://YOUR_API_ID.execute-api.localhost.floci.io:4566

### T01 Drive health — expect 200 and runtime "lambda"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health/drive
Accept: application/json

### T02 Donor health — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health/donor
Accept: application/json

### T03 Booking health — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health/booking
Accept: application/json

### T04 View drives — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drives
Accept: application/json

### T05 Invalid create drive — expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drives
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ORGANIZER_TOKEN

{}
### T06 Unknown route — expect 404 NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### T07 CORS preflight from local website — expect ACAO http://localhost:8090
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/drives
Origin: http://localhost:8090
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### T08 CORS preflight from an evil origin — expect no ACAO for that origin
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/drives
Origin: https://evil.example
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
